      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukamzera Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wizere wandu wa Israeli kukaia wikangia andenyi ya ijo isanga BWANA uwinekagha, wikakuwida viro, wirede visuke vawo va mavalo gha imbiri kwa mkohani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mkohani uchavisughusa imbiri ya BWANA, eri oho kurumirikie. Mkohani uchachisughusa icho kisuke ngelo ya nakesho, nyuma ya ituku ja Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ijo ituku jesughusa kisuke chako kuchafunya mwana wa ng'ondi wa womi wa mwaka ghumweri, useko na itiko ukaie kizongona chekora kwa BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huwo koni kuchafunya kilo iwi ra mufu ghuranganyiro na mavuda, ghipate kukaia kizongona cha viro. Irumba ja kizongona icho, jam'boiagha BWANA loli-loli. Icho kizongona kuchifunyanye na lita imweri ya divei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuseje mavalo mawishi gha makuwido ghako, hata kwameria kufunya icho kizongona kwa Mlungu. Mavalo agho kuseje ghikaiagha mawishi, ghiochelo, angu ghiochelo ghiwuye mkate, hata kwakatisha agho malaghiro; nagho kuchaghiwadia matuku ghose vivalwa vako vose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndima ya Makuwido",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kutale njumwa mfungade gi, kufuma ituku ja kawi ja ija Sabato koreredieghe kisuke cha viro vako kwa BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 23.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.34.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.9+DEU.16.10+DEU.16.11+DEU.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 16.9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja mirongo misanu, jiko nyuma ya iro Sabato mfungade, kumfunyire BWANA kizongona chimu cha agho mavalo mawishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula nyumba ichafunya mikate iwi, ipate kusughuswa. Kula mkate ghubonyo kwa kipimo cha mufu ghwa kilo iwi ghuko na chachu; nagho ghuchafunywa kwa BWANA ghukaie ifunyo ja mavalo gha imbiri gha viro vikuwidiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiaimweri na iyo mikate, wandu wichafunya wana wa ng'ondi mfungade wa mwaka ghumweri-ghumweri wiseko na itiko, na mwana wa njau, na bauru iwi; ripate kukaia kizongona chekora kwa BWANA, chiaimweri na kizongona cha viro na kizongona cha kunywa; mafunyo agho gheko na irumba jim'boiagha BWANA loli-loli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena kufunye fwandi ikaie kizongona kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a, na wana wa ng'ondi wawi wa mwaka ghumweri-ghumweri wikaie kizongona cha mapatano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mkohani uchawisughusa chiaimweri na ugho mkate, vikaie kizongona chesughuswa kwa BWANA kwa wundu ghwa mkohani, mafunyo agho ni gha wueli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ijo, msebonye kazi ingi, ela mkwanyike kwa wutasi. Vivalwa venyu vichanugha sharia ihi matuku ghose ghichagha, andu uko kose wichaakaia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
